---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Joner Football Homepage Concept | Prototype"
  description="Cinematic Joner Football homepage concept inspired by premium product storytelling."
>
  <section class="bg-joner-black text-white min-h-screen pt-24 pb-16">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-joner-red text-sm mb-4">Homepage Direction</p>
      <h1 class="font-heading uppercase text-5xl md:text-8xl leading-none max-w-5xl mb-6">Cinematic Product Story</h1>
      <p class="font-body text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mb-8">
        This is the safe staging page for the new Joner homepage direction. The first piece to approve is the pinned football hero prototype.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
        <a href="/prototypes/joner-hero-prototype.html" class="btn-red" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Hero Prototype</a>
        <a href="/" class="btn-outline">Current Homepage</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white text-joner-black py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="border border-gray-200 p-6">
        <p class="font-heading uppercase text-joner-red tracking-widest text-sm mb-3">01</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading uppercase text-3xl mb-3">Pinned Hero First</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-gray-700">Build the spinning Joner ball story before touching the rest of the homepage.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-gray-200 p-6">
        <p class="font-heading uppercase text-joner-red tracking-widest text-sm mb-3">02</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading uppercase text-3xl mb-3">Homepage After</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-gray-700">Once the hero feels right, rebuild the homepage sections around the same black, white, red rhythm.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-gray-200 p-6">
        <p class="font-heading uppercase text-joner-red tracking-widest text-sm mb-3">03</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading uppercase text-3xl mb-3">Protect Speed</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-gray-700">No heavy clone. Procedural ball first, real GLB later if the concept proves itself.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
